Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:05:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BL_Improve PStart OpenCV diagnostics and MAX image analysis

Date: 2026-10-13

Summary:
- Initialize OpenCV at Android startup and expose an independent health check.
- Return detailed diagnostics for analyzer failures.
- Use the Android SHA-256 endpoint when crypto.subtle is unavailable.
- Include REF01-REF05 MIN and MAX images in optical analysis.
- Keep REF00 MIN and MAX images as XMP metadata sources only.
- Preserve PStart session result and diagnostics logging.
- Include versioned PDF and editable DOCX project documentation.
- Keep the existing project root and software version 0.9841.
- Android build and device validation remain outstanding.

